msgid "AirPixel ENTIRE R3 for Camera Control and EXIF Geotagging"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:11
#: 21cff1d3ed194dc5af16f2dc208041f5
msgid "The `ENTIRE R3 <https://airpixel.cz/entire-r3>`_ is a standalone device for GeoTagging of images in-camera SD card.  GPS data data is read from the autopilot's serial port (aka MAVLink bus) and is then saved directly into the photos using EXIF. The ENTIRE can also trigger the camera shutter via MAVLink commands, control video recording and zoom and many other commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:13
#: 958376d986a442d09ba497441cbf892d
msgid "Compatible with Sony A7 series, A9 Series and many other Sony models"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:14
#: 3efd5a9affff4355a2734f7f6e13a8b2
msgid "Compatible also with ADTi cameras, ShareUAV cameras or ViewPro cameras"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:15
#: 4109b9d6b5624072954be6814f5429e6
msgid "Photos are tagged (via EXIF) with the lat, lon, altitude and camera angles (read from the gimbal) within the camera"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-geotagging-airpixel-entire.rst:16
